  "title": "Add Custom Battle Rewards [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "独自の戦闘報酬を追加【RPGツクールMZ&MVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "523b2ad3a4e603e6949f839881172d5267480d2370e9a30a470c721a1d03c463",
      "translation": "Add Custom Battle Rewards [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "523b2ad3a4e603e6949f839881172d5267480d2370e9a30a470c721a1d03c463"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "独自の戦闘報酬を追加し、変数へと格納します。",
      "sourceHash": "0505748815db61cf443e2a04f1d94bf4280076c6f4ca008bbbea620973422eec",
      "translation": "Adds custom battle rewards and stores them in variables.",
      "contextHash": "0505748815db61cf443e2a04f1d94bf4280076c6f4ca008bbbea620973422eec"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "上記の例では、お金とは別に魔石を獲得しています。",
      "sourceHash": "7498391ba16a54ba5ea812b1ada382924e62d4749f96009f4a6583b3d18f1059",
      "translation": "In the example above, a magic stone is obtained separately from money.",
      "contextHash": "7498391ba16a54ba5ea812b1ada382924e62d4749f96009f4a6583b3d18f1059"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のファイルをダウンロードし 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "add69b36d300edf1592f52945943668587da00473f5edb9e6c87aeb402e1aa25",
      "translation": "Download the following file and place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Turn the feature ON from the plugin manager in RPG Maker.",
      "contextHash": "add69b36d300edf1592f52945943668587da00473f5edb9e6c87aeb402e1aa25"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＶ、ＭＺの両方で有効です。",
      "sourceHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5",
      "translation": "※This plugin works with both MV and MZ.",
      "contextHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5"
    },
    {
