    },
    {
      "id": "list-001",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "公開！",
      "sourceHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664",
      "translation": "Released!",
      "contextHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-005",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "使用方法（Usage）",
      "sourceHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9",
      "translation": "Usage (Usage)",
      "contextHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータの『報酬リスト』に独自報酬を設定してください。",
      "sourceHash": "1697616e0db5b030b2c2de8301d95e83d2b80bd5f59216b329341775c8e835cf",
      "translation": "Set the custom rewards in the plugin parameter “Reward List.”",
      "contextHash": "1697616e0db5b030b2c2de8301d95e83d2b80bd5f59216b329341775c8e835cf"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下の二通りの方法で敵毎の報酬を設定できます。",
      "sourceHash": "9c33cd3359971c3f97144fa3f5e771cd9488dc11faf65de0b832bfc8e617521b",
      "translation": "You can set rewards for each enemy using the following two methods.",
      "contextHash": "9c33cd3359971c3f97144fa3f5e771cd9488dc11faf65de0b832bfc8e617521b"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-006",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "１．定義名を設定する。",
      "sourceHash": "d4f83dda65650481cba5f1b7e54b0153264910d908ff0f9fcc9b9fa437066861",
      "translation": "1. Set a definition name.",
      "contextHash": "d4f83dda65650481cba5f1b7e54b0153264910d908ff0f9fcc9b9fa437066861"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "敵キャラのメモ欄に定義名と値を記述します。",
      "sourceHash": "987584a59ba8d65568ceb630eb5200b7af5d230623d786c49782e516bb655972",
      "translation": "Write the definition name and value in the enemy's note field.",
      "contextHash": "987584a59ba8d65568ceb630eb5200b7af5d230623d786c49782e516bb655972"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "定義名がTestRewardならば、",
      "sourceHash": "52d8efa16e25d680a945379b37c1f5ac3245ebd468b5ae21a7de93a95aa91086",
      "translation": "If the definition name is TestReward,",
      "contextHash": "52d8efa16e25d680a945379b37c1f5ac3245ebd468b5ae21a7de93a95aa91086"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "となります。",
      "sourceHash": "ed551a0f0732edc3bec983a373f519c7feb3d783741f8f50bfb82d15cb970f96",
      "translation": "it will be as follows.",
      "contextHash": "ed551a0f0732edc3bec983a373f519c7feb3d783741f8f50bfb82d15cb970f96"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-007",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "２．既定値を設定する。",
      "sourceHash": "87eb969a6749c2cd68ff07431b6e00f38cd267cfcedae6c13320f87bfb2d5c39",
      "translation": "2. Set a default value.",
      "contextHash": "87eb969a6749c2cd68ff07431b6e00f38cd267cfcedae6c13320f87bfb2d5c39"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "例えば「a.gold() / 10」ならば、敵の所持金の1/10を独自報酬として獲得します。",
      "sourceHash": "62e5a919ccbcb002da1e72f7e4b1dfcc05d7899db300773d6daee1f49a3e669f",
      "translation": "For example, “a.gold() / 10” awards one-tenth of the enemy's gold as a custom reward.",
      "contextHash": "62e5a919ccbcb002da1e72f7e4b1dfcc05d7899db300773d6daee1f49a3e669f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "一体ずつ設定するのが面倒という場合にオススメです。",
      "sourceHash": "4de5569158ee3bc38ba9b3c169f65776add42819d1dbed372c26881d49e678b8",
      "translation": "This is recommended when setting each enemy individually is inconvenient.",
      "contextHash": "4de5569158ee3bc38ba9b3c169f65776add42819d1dbed372c26881d49e678b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "上記は併用も可能です。",
      "sourceHash": "c7d0f700e2d4b49af8cf5bd93c6c6cdec48443e5cbb49bbe39e7a13269251bf5",
      "translation": "The above methods can also be used together.",
      "contextHash": "c7d0f700e2d4b49af8cf5bd93c6c6cdec48443e5cbb49bbe39e7a13269251bf5"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-014",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "定義名を指定した場合はそちらが優先されますので、ボスのみ固定値にするといった使い方もできます。",
      "sourceHash": "2666a7ac756badf6435eb81844285fdf7073ec83fddea2a254bbf474e0fe5ee3",
      "translation": "If a definition name is specified, it takes priority, so you can use a fixed value only for bosses, for example.",
      "contextHash": "2666a7ac756badf6435eb81844285fdf7073ec83fddea2a254bbf474e0fe5ee3"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-008",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "倍率指定（Rated Value）",
      "sourceHash": "31001ed280d25f23c8fb5a06a5be0b7f2ce82445e8e1bab68b0b14892459039a",
      "translation": "Rate Specification (Rated Value)",
      "contextHash": "31001ed280d25f23c8fb5a06a5be0b7f2ce82445e8e1bab68b0b14892459039a"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-015",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "定義名の後にRateを付けると、既定値に対する倍率指定になります。",
      "sourceHash": "c2ac521f52a79c83e787205b97aab800ab4e3f18c8af5a9fc7ee42c57a91cf9e",
      "translation": "Appending Rate to the definition name allows you to specify a multiplier for the default value.",
      "contextHash": "c2ac521f52a79c83e787205b97aab800ab4e3f18c8af5a9fc7ee42c57a91cf9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-016",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "例えば、定義名がTestRewardならば、",
      "sourceHash": "43b55b0f3da281be55810123e484db7879a08348aa35f84a90089b99f2020145",
      "translation": "For example, if the definition name is TestReward,",
      "contextHash": "43b55b0f3da281be55810123e484db7879a08348aa35f84a90089b99f2020145"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-017",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "とすると、既定値の２倍の独自報酬を取得できます。",
      "sourceHash": "afb0620b3323ab11048fb338d645cdf12b0c270ce92a7877ac5ee0aee42e2e74",
      "translation": "you can obtain a custom reward twice the default value.",
      "contextHash": "afb0620b3323ab11048fb338d645cdf12b0c270ce92a7877ac5ee0aee42e2e74"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ（Plugin Parameters）",
      "sourceHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad",
      "translation": "Plugin Parameters (Plugin Parameters)",
      "contextHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-010",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "報酬リスト（RewardList）",
      "sourceHash": "996f4ecf3affa9d6b2e954df64069fdeac858274d77373d6a1eae5af3e007488",
      "translation": "Reward List (RewardList)",
      "contextHash": "996f4ecf3affa9d6b2e954df64069fdeac858274d77373d6a1eae5af3e007488"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-018",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "追加の報酬を定義します。",
      "sourceHash": "3fc0fbe5f741d26ee373397d883471b549f8d2c57561fcea9fee2eed08c10884",
      "translation": "Defines additional rewards.",
      "contextHash": "3fc0fbe5f741d26ee373397d883471b549f8d2c57561fcea9fee2eed08c10884"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-011",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "報酬リストのパラメータ（Reward Parameters）",
      "sourceHash": "f0b7c206787422684634cab88d6ec3b32c146ae949e234990e3a3908f49fd106",
      "translation": "Reward List Parameters (Reward Parameters)",
      "contextHash": "f0b7c206787422684634cab88d6ec3b32c146ae949e234990e3a3908f49fd106"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-012",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "名前（Name）",
      "sourceHash": "ac15bb525a28da2fe1b05b212d717083e7979716ed36cfd69fb317def583571c",
      "translation": "Name (Name)",
      "contextHash": "ac15bb525a28da2fe1b05b212d717083e7979716ed36cfd69fb317def583571c"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-019",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "報酬の名称です。",
      "sourceHash": "cc1f700a3a7a2596e837bbbf10b5c6a1e47ff1d8fa1544ccfff3967317466e17",
      "translation": "The name of the reward.",
      "contextHash": "cc1f700a3a7a2596e837bbbf10b5c6a1e47ff1d8fa1544ccfff3967317466e17"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-013",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "定義名（MetaName）",
      "sourceHash": "ecf148d59ec247851794c2625f078781fdc945c1ba7149a2c735c540ca22d224",
      "translation": "Definition Name (MetaName)",
      "contextHash": "ecf148d59ec247851794c2625f078781fdc945c1ba7149a2c735c540ca22d224"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-020",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "報酬の定義名です。",
      "sourceHash": "74c10f84b78b08327f6d5449163ea75e8c37364f7c8ef79ba3f59cd9c06847bf",
      "translation": "The definition name of the reward.",
      "contextHash": "74c10f84b78b08327f6d5449163ea75e8c37364f7c8ef79ba3f59cd9c06847bf"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-021",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "敵のメモ欄に<XXX:100>というように記述すれば獲得されます。",
      "sourceHash": "e9204ebf8118a7f06ec312cc764d93b48bf76fd69642067a68f147d9c533bdca",
      "translation": "The reward is obtained by writing <XXX:100> in the enemy's note field.",
      "contextHash": "e9204ebf8118a7f06ec312cc764d93b48bf76fd69642067a68f147d9c533bdca"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-014",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "獲得メッセージ（GainMessage）",
      "sourceHash": "05b6edfbc9547d41a4bf7c3501ea83155c4b37d55e162e96186ba151871a8d8e",
      "translation": "Gain Message (GainMessage)",
      "contextHash": "05b6edfbc9547d41a4bf7c3501ea83155c4b37d55e162e96186ba151871a8d8e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-022",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "獲得メッセージです。",
      "sourceHash": "0aff049f5e51821d03fc03013388659de95e22a5fec1b1dfa5ca117f1f988eec",
      "translation": "The message displayed when the reward is obtained.",
      "contextHash": "0aff049f5e51821d03fc03013388659de95e22a5fec1b1dfa5ca117f1f988eec"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-023",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "%1に値、%2に名前が表示されます。",
      "sourceHash": "8453e93059e2e8b5615e9ba366dfc8df790528e1f455f40ae6ffb14075b9246e",
      "translation": "%1 displays the value, and %2 displays the name.",
      "contextHash": "8453e93059e2e8b5615e9ba366dfc8df790528e1f455f40ae6ffb14075b9246e"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-015",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "メッセージの表示位置（GainMessagePosition）",
      "sourceHash": "aeb07fdb9b9b116ad4d481b6da2001955e674aa36f8100503aace4e6e553b4ef",
      "translation": "Gain Message Position (GainMessagePosition)",
      "contextHash": "aeb07fdb9b9b116ad4d481b6da2001955e674aa36f8100503aace4e6e553b4ef"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-024",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "獲得メッセージを表示する位置です。",
      "sourceHash": "16b7b531df736e6dfdfa558567d17bbd41175eec45aafeb16f45e703351213e5",
      "translation": "The position where the gain message is displayed.",
      "contextHash": "16b7b531df736e6dfdfa558567d17bbd41175eec45aafeb16f45e703351213e5"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-016",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "変数（Variable）",
      "sourceHash": "c1f27ffbbd79611c7d2938259d787f9d9b6ba6b6008be04d91714c7dd8c5419d",
      "translation": "Variable (Variable)",
      "contextHash": "c1f27ffbbd79611c7d2938259d787f9d9b6ba6b6008be04d91714c7dd8c5419d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-025",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "報酬を管理する変数です。",
      "sourceHash": "4a67ebf25207aa684b914678269a0cd816997f8c20d0d37da038f2b1c3925ac7",
      "translation": "The variable used to manage the reward.",
      "contextHash": "4a67ebf25207aa684b914678269a0cd816997f8c20d0d37da038f2b1c3925ac7"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-017",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "既定値（DefaultValue）",
      "sourceHash": "b32b82b449e6aabd8a39f113fbc870328961314e997f8688a62af6f1acc1a2df",
      "translation": "Default Value (DefaultValue)",
      "contextHash": "b32b82b449e6aabd8a39f113fbc870328961314e997f8688a62af6f1acc1a2df"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-026",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "報酬の既定値です。",
      "sourceHash": "7c4115a5dce9a9d7a29d4a336e19c2a7f17031b2f47b3a5b1f553ed0edc583c6",
      "translation": "The default value of the reward.",
      "contextHash": "7c4115a5dce9a9d7a29d4a336e19c2a7f17031b2f47b3a5b1f553ed0edc583c6"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-027",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "（例：a.gold() / 10）など。",
      "sourceHash": "1ed6ccab1f76a681d1fd737c92e0908b2c5418da5399e0558b6e48f3fc100bd1",
      "translation": "(Example: a.gold() / 10)",
      "contextHash": "1ed6ccab1f76a681d1fd737c92e0908b2c5418da5399e0558b6e48f3fc100bd1"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-018",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "最大値（MaxValue）",
      "sourceHash": "7544dededbb92d7c68961f0e3017369122cdf404e4b0d0d865085fa9fa2185c3",
      "translation": "Maximum Value (MaxValue)",
      "contextHash": "7544dededbb92d7c68961f0e3017369122cdf404e4b0d0d865085fa9fa2185c3"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-028",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "報酬の最大値です。",
      "sourceHash": "946727cd36a873abc4e4dda7072f0623ef9afc772f7c4d222651ce1aaca74a6f",
      "translation": "The maximum value of the reward.",
      "contextHash": "946727cd36a873abc4e4dda7072f0623ef9afc772f7c4d222651ce1aaca74a6f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-029",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "変数はこの値以上にはなりません。",
      "sourceHash": "3a7aafe85c9b9098684f6162b7e12521612f3ca927a6b825ede49b0d78724c66",
      "translation": "The variable will not exceed this value.",
      "contextHash": "3a7aafe85c9b9098684f6162b7e12521612f3ca927a6b825ede49b0d78724c66"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-019",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "スイッチ（Switch）",
      "sourceHash": "47d3a1306fa93ec24f65abc28fc9e4790ce4e05a03f888af5f4024e2d2e5ea78",
      "translation": "Switch (Switch)",
      "contextHash": "47d3a1306fa93ec24f65abc28fc9e4790ce4e05a03f888af5f4024e2d2e5ea78"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-030",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "報酬が有効となるスイッチです。",
      "sourceHash": "f49c8a48bbd00d6075cd26d3ea24a73a440ab65516831e2326ae0ab85d6c2c5e",
      "translation": "The switch that enables the reward.",
      "contextHash": "f49c8a48bbd00d6075cd26d3ea24a73a440ab65516831e2326ae0ab85d6c2c5e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-031",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "空欄なら常に有効となります。",
      "sourceHash": "5402e7ff07c0c67b442b7810900e559a832ead93a3bdaa3411987921a61e8ef0",
      "translation": "If left blank, it is always enabled.",
      "contextHash": "5402e7ff07c0c67b442b7810900e559a832ead93a3bdaa3411987921a61e8ef0"
    }
  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "line-001",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "また、[[LINK_1]]独自通貨を使用した店を作成するプラグイン[[/LINK_1]]と組み合わせることも可能です。",
      "sourceHash": "104e62c6cd01d6c49fb2203207b113f31ff5161841d6d26a7e58623edd3d9065",
      "parts": [
        {
          "source": "また、",
          "link": false
        },
        {
          "source": "独自通貨を使用した店を作成するプラグイン",
          "link": true,
          "linkIndex": 1
        },
        {
          "source": "と組み合わせることも可能です。",
          "link": false
        }
      ],
      "translation": "It can also be combined with a [[LINK_1]]plugin for creating shops that use a custom currency[[/LINK_1]].",
      "contextHash": "104e62c6cd01d6c49fb2203207b113f31ff5161841d6d26a7e58623edd3d9065"
    },
